292
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:38,180
The station's more
peaceful without me, right?

293
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:40,700
Well, that's the thing is...

294
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,860
Wow, just by saying I'm being transferred,

295
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:53,860
