296
00:15:53,860 --> 00:15:57,080
Still, the Commissioner-General's
voice really packs a punch

297
00:15:58,580 --> 00:16:01,040
And all I did was talk
through a voice scrambler.

298
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:02,720
They fell for it so easily.

299
00:16:03,380 --> 00:16:05,620
As if I'd ever disappear!

300
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:09,280
Let's enjoy this situation for a while,
shall we?

301
00:16:13,620 --> 00:16:16,280
Well, when I look at Ryotsu these days,

302
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:18,720
what do you mean when
you look at him, Chief?

303
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:21,760
Well, it feels like
only until just recently,

304
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,860
he was like a child who
needed constant looking after,

305
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:26,340
but now he's suddenly grown up.

306
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:29,900
And when I think of us going
on to nurture this police box,

307
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:33,160
I suddenly feel a bit lonely, somehow.

308
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:37,440
The same goes for us, Chief.

309
00:16:38,380 --> 00:16:40,560
Though he's caused us all sorts of trouble,

310
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:44,000
when I think that Ryo-san
won't be teasing us anymore,

311
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:45,300
somehow I...

312
00:16:46,860 --> 00:16:49,800
Ryo-chan,
you're really going to be gone, aren't you?

313
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:53,640
Though we always got caught
up in all sorts of trouble,

314
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:58,760
