it all seems like it was fun.

315
00:16:59,460 --> 00:17:04,100
We always assumed Senpai would be at this police box,
didn't we?

316
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:09,220
I can't even imagine this
police box without Senpai.

317
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:15,580
There's no need to cry, is there?
No need to cry.

318
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,180
Yoko, Machi, Naoko

319
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:20,260
W-what is it, you caveman?

320
00:17:20,260 --> 00:17:20,920
What is it?

321
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:23,740
No, I just had a little free time.

322
00:17:23,740 --> 00:17:25,960
A fresh green light

323
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:29,980
Let's see... am I the number one man nobody wants to marry,
once again?

324
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:35,060
Officer Kankichi Ryotsu has
been transferred to headquarters.

325
00:17:35,060 --> 00:17:37,940
As such, a commemorative
gift from Katsushika Station.

326
00:17:37,940 --> 00:17:38,660
This is...

327
00:17:40,260 --> 00:17:41,460
It's nothing.

328
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,520
You guys

329
00:17:44,300 --> 00:17:45,180
What?

330
00:17:45,180 --> 00:17:48,780
Even without you, I'm not sad at all,

331
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:50,840
I'm not sad, you know.

332
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:54,580
That's right, just hurry up and go
to headquarters or wherever you want!

333
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:56,160
You, you...

334
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:14,940
Damn, this is really no fun at all

335
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:17,520
This makes me look like the bad guy,
doesn't it?

336
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:21,060
Shall we go out for a
quick drink to send him off?

337
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:23,480
Damn it!

338
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:24,900
That's just too much, isn't it?

339
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:26,080
So suddenly, you know.

340
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:28,280
Him just disappearing
all of a sudden like this.

341
00:18:30,780 --> 00:18:31,800
Really, it is.

342
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:35,520
Isn't there some way we could make him stay?

343
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:36,720
You idiot!

344
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,680
What are you talking about?

345
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:39,460
Headquarters will be giving him good marks,
you know.

346
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:41,660
If you think about Ryo-san's happiness,

347
00:18:41,660 --> 00:18:43,860
