350
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:50,900
We really looked forward to that, didn't we.

351
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:55,480
Despite all the complaining,
everyone really likes Ryo-san, don't they?

352
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:01,880
Don't cry!
A grown man shouldn't be seen crying!

353
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:05,320
Damn it, I'm getting teary-eyed too, dammit.

354
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,860
Ahhh, this is no fun at all.

355
00:19:14,860 --> 00:19:16,960
Honestly, every last one of them,

356
