377
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:52,460
I guess the pain of parting with you
must have made me dream that, Senpai.

378
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:57,540
Next, greetings from the
shopping district association.

379
00:20:57,540 --> 00:21:00,840
