387
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:20,560
Chief.

388
00:21:20,560 --> 00:21:23,640
Looking back, ever since the day we met,

389
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:27,180
I have always thought of you as a son.

390
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:30,580
It'll be lonely without you around.

391
00:21:31,820 --> 00:21:35,560
But I have countless memories with you.

392
00:21:35,560 --> 00:21:37,420
So I'll be fine.

393
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:39,900
You too, work hard at your new post.

394
00:21:39,900 --> 00:21:42,500
Make sure you really do your best.

395
