Well, Chief, the truth is...

396
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:56,500
Then, allow me to deliver the
opening remarks for Kankichi Ryotsu.

397
00:21:56,500 --> 00:21:58,340
I'd like to lead three banzai cheers.

398
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:01,220
Banzai to Kankichi Ryotsu!

399
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:02,800
Yes.

400
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:05,800
Aaaaaah!

401
00:22:25,980 --> 00:22:30,140
Yes, it was blown,
but the Commissioner-General's a

